    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, you're tasked with the duty of the interrogator. This time around, you're backed up with a partner, Charles. He's an interrogator too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you'll investigate and potentially solve a number of cases and defeat the crime once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that the game features a small embedding model localized within game's files, not an advanced AI system like LLM/Llama/GPT. It runs locally, on your computer, game doesn't require any internet connection. If you're expecting an immersive AI experience, you <strong>will\u00a0</strong>be disappointed. The Primary tool of input is either word of mouth or written text. Conversation is the main focus of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes an unholy amount of AI-generated content, including, but not limited to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Textures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facial and body animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a humorous aspect to the game, intentional and otherwise. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, you're tasked with the duty of the interrogator. This time around, you're backed up with a partner, Charles. He's an interrogator too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you'll investigate and potentially solve a number of cases and defeat the crime once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that the game features a small embedding model localized within game's files, not an advanced AI system like LLM/Llama/GPT. It runs locally, on your computer, game doesn't require any internet connection. If you're expecting an immersive AI experience, you <strong>will\u00a0</strong>be disappointed. The Primary tool of input is either word of mouth or written text. Conversation is the main focus of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes an unholy amount of AI-generated content, including, but not limited to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Textures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facial and body animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a humorous aspect to the game, intentional and otherwise. </p>",
